<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Void">N/A</span></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p class="code">draw_set_halign(fa_center);<br/> draw_set_valign(fa_middle);
<br/> draw_text_ext_transformed_colour(200, 200, &quot;My name is&quot; + global.name +&quot;.&quot;, 20, 200, 0.5, 0.5, 180, c_blue, c_blue, c_navy, c_navy, 1);</p>
<p>This will draw the given text with a blue to dark blue downward gradient, at position (200,200) in the room, rotated to be upside down and at half the normal point size of the font. There will be 20 pixels between each line should there be more than
one line drawn and each line will have a maximum width of 200 pixels.</p>
<p> </p>
